  "tips": "Always start with the most restrictive constraints like greater than 9 or very specific sums like 1 or 12. If you see an empty region, remember it just means those pips don't count toward a total, so use your leftover high or low numbers there. Finally, try to visualize which dominoes have the specific numbers you need for equals regions before you start placing them.",
